        // We recover the log by deploying the same way setUp did is not possible; instead we use
        // the getter through a low-level call on C's stored log via the known address pattern.
        // Simplest admissible route: the Log deployed in setUp is the only Log; use a second C? No —
        // instead, store the log in setUp via the constructor argument we passed ourselves.
    }
}
